{"1":{"w":[{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Has"},{"c":"أَتَى","d":"atā","e":"(there) come"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانِ","d":"l-insāni","e":"man"},{"c":"حِينٌ","d":"ḥīnun","e":"a period"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الدَّهْرِ","d":"l-dahri","e":"time"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"يَكُنْ","d":"yakun","e":"he was"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"a thing"},{"c":"مَذْكُورًا","d":"madhkūran","e":"mentioned"}],"a":{"g":"Has there [not] come upon man a period of time when he was not a thing [even] mentioned?"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"[We] created"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"man"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"نُطْفَةٍ","d":"nuṭ'fatin","e":"a sperm-drop"},{"c":"أَمْشَاجٍ","d":"amshājin","e":"mixture"},{"c":"نَبْتَلِيهِ","d":"nabtalīhi","e":"(that) We test him;"},{"c":"فَجَعَلْنَاهُ","d":"fajaʿalnāhu","e":"so We made (for) him"},{"c":"سَمِيعًا","d":"samīʿan","e":"hearing"},{"c":"بَصِيرًا","d":"baṣīran","e":"and sight"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We created man from a sperm-drop mixture that We may try him; and We made him hearing and seeing."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"هَدَيْنَاهُ","d":"hadaynāhu","e":"guided him"},{"c":"السَّبِيلَ","d":"l-sabīla","e":"(to) the way"},{"c":"إِمَّا","d":"immā","e":"whether"},{"c":"شَاكِرًا","d":"shākiran","e":"(he) be grateful"},{"c":"وَإِمَّا","d":"wa-immā","e":"and whether"},{"c":"كَفُورًا","d":"kafūran","e":"(he) be ungrateful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We guided him to the way, be he grateful or be he ungrateful."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَعْتَدْنَا","d":"aʿtadnā","e":"[We] have prepared"},{"c":"لِلْكَافِرِينَ","d":"lil'kāfirīna","e":"for the disbelievers"},{"c":"سَلَاسِلَا","d":"salāsilā","e":"chains"},{"c":"وَأَغْلَالًا","d":"wa-aghlālan","e":"and shackles"},{"c":"وَسَعِيرًا","d":"wasaʿīran","e":"and a Blazing Fire"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have prepared for the disbelievers chains and shackles and a blaze."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْأَبْرَارَ","d":"l-abrāra","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"يَشْرَبُونَ","d":"yashrabūna","e":"will drink"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"كَأْسٍ","d":"kasin","e":"a cup"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"مِزَاجُهَا","d":"mizājuhā","e":"its mixture"},{"c":"كَافُورًا","d":"kāfūran","e":"(of) Kafur"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will drink from a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of Kafur,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"عَيْنًا","d":"ʿaynan","e":"A spring"},{"c":"يَشْرَبُ","d":"yashrabu","e":"will drink"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"from it"},{"c":"عِبَادُ","d":"ʿibādu","e":"(the) slaves"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"يُفَجِّرُونَهَا","d":"yufajjirūnahā","e":"causing it to gush forth"},{"c":"تَفْجِيرًا","d":"tafjīran","e":"abundantly"}],"a":{"g":"A spring of which the [righteous] servants of Allah will drink; they will make it gush forth in force [and abundance]."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"يُوفُونَ","d":"yūfūna","e":"They fulfill"},{"c":"بِالنَّذْرِ","d":"bil-nadhri","e":"the vows"},{"c":"وَيَخَافُونَ","d":"wayakhāfūna","e":"and fear"},{"c":"يَوْمًا","d":"yawman","e":"a Day"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"(which) is"},{"c":"شَرُّهُ","d":"sharruhu","e":"its evil"},{"c":"مُسْتَطِيرًا","d":"mus'taṭīran","e":"widespread"}],"a":{"g":"They [are those who] fulfill [their] vows and fear a Day whose evil will be widespread."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَيُطْعِمُونَ","d":"wayuṭ'ʿimūna","e":"And they feed"},{"c":"الطَّعَامَ","d":"l-ṭaʿāma","e":"the food"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"in spite of"},{"c":"حُبِّهِ","d":"ḥubbihi","e":"love (for) it"},{"c":"مِسْكِينًا","d":"mis'kīnan","e":"(to the) needy"},{"c":"وَيَتِيمًا","d":"wayatīman","e":"and (the) orphan"},{"c":"وَأَسِيرًا","d":"wa-asīran","e":"and (the) captive"}],"a":{"g":"And they give food in spite of love for it to the needy, the orphan, and the captive,"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"نُطْعِمُكُمْ","d":"nuṭ'ʿimukum","e":"we feed you"},{"c":"لِوَجْهِ","d":"liwajhi","e":"for (the) Countenance"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"نُرِيدُ","d":"nurīdu","e":"we desire"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"from you"},{"c":"جَزَاءً","d":"jazāan","e":"any reward"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"شُكُورًا","d":"shukūran","e":"thanks"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], \"We feed you only for the countenance of Allah. We wish not from you reward or gratitude."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"نَخَافُ","d":"nakhāfu","e":"fear"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّنَا","d":"rabbinā","e":"our Lord"},{"c":"يَوْمًا","d":"yawman","e":"a Day"},{"c":"عَبُوسًا","d":"ʿabūsan","e":"harsh"},{"c":"قَمْطَرِيرًا","d":"qamṭarīran","e":"and distressful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We fear from our Lord a Day austere and distressful.\""}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"فَوَقَاهُمُ","d":"fawaqāhumu","e":"But will protect them"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"شَرَّ","d":"sharra","e":"(from the) evil"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"(of) that"},{"c":"الْيَوْمِ","d":"l-yawmi","e":"Day"},{"c":"وَلَقَّاهُمْ","d":"walaqqāhum","e":"and will cause them to meet"},{"c":"نَضْرَةً","d":"naḍratan","e":"radiance"},{"c":"وَسُرُورًا","d":"wasurūran","e":"and happiness"}],"a":{"g":"So Allah will protect them from the evil of that Day and give them radiance and happiness"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَزَاهُمْ","d":"wajazāhum","e":"And will reward them"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"because"},{"c":"صَبَرُوا","d":"ṣabarū","e":"they were patient"},{"c":"جَنَّةً","d":"jannatan","e":"(with) a Garden"},{"c":"وَحَرِيرًا","d":"waḥarīran","e":"and silk"}],"a":{"g":"And will reward them for what they patiently endured [with] a garden [in Paradise] and silk [garments]."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"مُتَّكِئِينَ","d":"muttakiīna","e":"Reclining"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الْأَرَائِكِ","d":"l-arāiki","e":"couches"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَرَوْنَ","d":"yarawna","e":"they will see"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"شَمْسًا","d":"shamsan","e":"any sun"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"زَمْهَرِيرًا","d":"zamharīran","e":"freezing cold"}],"a":{"g":"[They will be] reclining therein on adorned couches. They will not see therein any [burning] sun or [freezing] cold."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَدَانِيَةً","d":"wadāniyatan","e":"And near"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"above them"},{"c":"ظِلَالُهَا","d":"ẓilāluhā","e":"(are) its shades"},{"c":"وَذُلِّلَتْ","d":"wadhullilat","e":"and will hang low"},{"c":"قُطُوفُهَا","d":"quṭūfuhā","e":"its cluster of fruits"},{"c":"تَذْلِيلًا","d":"tadhlīlan","e":"very low"}],"a":{"g":"And near above them are its shades, and its [fruit] to be picked will be lowered in compliance."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَيُطَافُ","d":"wayuṭāfu","e":"And will be circulated"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"among them"},{"c":"بِءَانِيَةٍ","d":"biāniyatin","e":"vessels"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فِضَّةٍ","d":"fiḍḍatin","e":"silver"},{"c":"وَأَكْوَابٍ","d":"wa-akwābin","e":"and cups"},{"c":"كَانَتْ","d":"kānat","e":"that are"},{"c":"قَوَارِيرَا","d":"qawārīrā","e":"(of) crystal"}],"a":{"g":"And there will be circulated among them vessels of silver and cups having been [created] clear [as glass],"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"قَوَارِيرَا","d":"qawārīrā","e":"Crystal-clear"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فِضَّةٍ","d":"fiḍḍatin","e":"silver"},{"c":"قَدَّرُوهَا","d":"qaddarūhā","e":"They will determine its"},{"c":"تَقْدِيرًا","d":"taqdīran","e":"measure"}],"a":{"g":"Clear glasses [made] from silver of which they have determined the measure."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَيُسْقَوْنَ","d":"wayus'qawna","e":"And they will be given to drink"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"كَأْسًا","d":"kasan","e":"a cup"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"مِزَاجُهَا","d":"mizājuhā","e":"its mixture"},{"c":"زَنْجَبِيلًا","d":"zanjabīlan","e":"(of) Zanjabil"}],"a":{"g":"And they will be given to drink a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of ginger"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"عَيْنًا","d":"ʿaynan","e":"A spring"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"تُسَمَّى","d":"tusammā","e":"named"},{"c":"سَلْسَبِيلًا","d":"salsabīlan","e":"Salsabil"}],"a":{"g":"[From] a fountain within Paradise named Salsabeel."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَطُوفُ","d":"wayaṭūfu","e":"And will circulate"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"among them"},{"c":"وِلْدَانٌ","d":"wil'dānun","e":"young boys"},{"c":"مُخَلَّدُونَ","d":"mukhalladūna","e":"made eternal"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"رَأَيْتَهُمْ","d":"ra-aytahum","e":"you see them"},{"c":"حَسِبْتَهُمْ","d":"ḥasib'tahum","e":"you would think them"},{"c":"لُؤْلُؤًا","d":"lu'lu-an","e":"(as) pearls"},{"c":"مَنْثُورًا","d":"manthūran","e":"scattered"}],"a":{"g":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal. When you see them, you would think them [as beautiful as] scattered pearls."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"رَأَيْتَ","d":"ra-ayta","e":"you look"},{"c":"ثَمَّ","d":"thamma","e":"then"},{"c":"رَأَيْتَ","d":"ra-ayta","e":"you will see"},{"c":"نَعِيمًا","d":"naʿīman","e":"blessings"},{"c":"وَمُلْكًا","d":"wamul'kan","e":"and a kingdom"},{"c":"كَبِيرًا","d":"kabīran","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"And when you look there [in Paradise], you will see pleasure and great dominion."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"عَالِيَهُمْ","d":"ʿāliyahum","e":"Upon them"},{"c":"ثِيَابُ","d":"thiyābu","e":"(will be) garments"},{"c":"سُنْدُسٍ","d":"sundusin","e":"(of) fine silk"},{"c":"خُضْرٌ","d":"khuḍ'run","e":"green"},{"c":"وَإِسْتَبْرَقٌ","d":"wa-is'tabraqun","e":"and heavy brocade"},{"c":"وَحُلُّوا","d":"waḥullū","e":"And they will be adorned"},{"c":"أَسَاوِرَ","d":"asāwira","e":"(with) bracelets"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فِضَّةٍ","d":"fiḍḍatin","e":"silver"},{"c":"وَسَقَاهُمْ","d":"wasaqāhum","e":"and will give them to drink"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"شَرَابًا","d":"sharāban","e":"a drink"},{"c":"طَهُورًا","d":"ṭahūran","e":"pure"}],"a":{"g":"Upon the inhabitants will be green garments of fine silk and brocade. And they will be adorned with bracelets of silver, and their Lord will give them a purifying drink."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"جَزَاءً","d":"jazāan","e":"a reward"},{"c":"وَكَانَ","d":"wakāna","e":"and has been"},{"c":"سَعْيُكُمْ","d":"saʿyukum","e":"your effort"},{"c":"مَشْكُورًا","d":"mashkūran","e":"appreciated"}],"a":{"g":"[And it will be said], \"Indeed, this is for you a reward, and your effort has been appreciated.\""}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"[We]"},{"c":"نَزَّلْنَا","d":"nazzalnā","e":"[We] revealed"},{"c":"عَلَيْكَ","d":"ʿalayka","e":"to you"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"تَنْزِيلًا","d":"tanzīlan","e":"progressively"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is We who have sent down to you, [O Muhammad], the Qur'an progressively."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْبِرْ","d":"fa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"لِحُكْمِ","d":"liḥuk'mi","e":"for (the) Command"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تُطِعْ","d":"tuṭiʿ","e":"obey"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from them"},{"c":"ءَاثِمًا","d":"āthiman","e":"any sinner"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"كَفُورًا","d":"kafūran","e":"disbeliever"}],"a":{"g":"So be patient for the decision of your Lord and do not obey from among them a sinner or ungrateful [disbeliever]."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَاذْكُرِ","d":"wa-udh'kuri","e":"And remember"},{"c":"اسْمَ","d":"is'ma","e":"(the) name"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"بُكْرَةً","d":"buk'ratan","e":"morning"},{"c":"وَأَصِيلًا","d":"wa-aṣīlan","e":"and evening"}],"a":{"g":"And mention the name of your Lord [in prayer] morning and evening"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"And of"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"فَاسْجُدْ","d":"fa-us'jud","e":"prostrate"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to Him"},{"c":"وَسَبِّحْهُ","d":"wasabbiḥ'hu","e":"and glorify Him"},{"c":"لَيْلًا","d":"laylan","e":"a night"},{"c":"طَوِيلًا","d":"ṭawīlan","e":"long"}],"a":{"g":"And during the night prostrate to Him and exalt Him a long [part of the] night."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"يُحِبُّونَ","d":"yuḥibbūna","e":"love"},{"c":"الْعَاجِلَةَ","d":"l-ʿājilata","e":"the immediate"},{"c":"وَيَذَرُونَ","d":"wayadharūna","e":"and leave"},{"c":"وَرَاءَهُمْ","d":"warāahum","e":"behind them"},{"c":"يَوْمًا","d":"yawman","e":"a Day"},{"c":"ثَقِيلًا","d":"thaqīlan","e":"grave"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, these [disbelievers] love the immediate and leave behind them a grave Day."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُمْ","d":"khalaqnāhum","e":"created them"},{"c":"وَشَدَدْنَا","d":"washadadnā","e":"and We strengthened"},{"c":"أَسْرَهُمْ","d":"asrahum","e":"their forms"},{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"and when"},{"c":"شِئْنَا","d":"shi'nā","e":"We will"},{"c":"بَدَّلْنَا","d":"baddalnā","e":"We can change"},{"c":"أَمْثَالَهُمْ","d":"amthālahum","e":"their likeness[es]"},{"c":"تَبْدِيلًا","d":"tabdīlan","e":"(with) a change"}],"a":{"g":"We have created them and strengthened their forms, and when We will, We can change their likenesses with [complete] alteration."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذِهِ","d":"hādhihi","e":"this"},{"c":"تَذْكِرَةٌ","d":"tadhkiratun","e":"(is) a reminder"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"so whoever"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"wills"},{"c":"اتَّخَذَ","d":"ittakhadha","e":"let him take"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"سَبِيلًا","d":"sabīlan","e":"a way"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, this is a reminder, so he who wills may take to his Lord a way."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَشَاءُونَ","d":"tashāūna","e":"you will"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يَشَاءَ","d":"yashāa","e":"wills"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"عَلِيمًا","d":"ʿalīman","e":"All-Knower"},{"c":"حَكِيمًا","d":"ḥakīman","e":"All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"And you do not will except that Allah wills. Indeed, Allah is ever Knowing and Wise."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"يُدْخِلُ","d":"yud'khilu","e":"He admits"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"to"},{"c":"رَحْمَتِهِ","d":"raḥmatihi","e":"His mercy"},{"c":"وَالظَّالِمِينَ","d":"wal-ẓālimīna","e":"but (for) the wrongdoers"},{"c":"أَعَدَّ","d":"aʿadda","e":"He has prepared"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"عَذَابًا","d":"ʿadhāban","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمًا","d":"alīman","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"He admits whom He wills into His mercy; but the wrongdoers - He has prepared for them a painful punishment."}}}